# Preferences - the base of every user preferences class. A subclass lives in
# trash/user/, which Git ignores, and holds one literal send per line:
#
#   Chaz subclass: Preferences
#     Agent::JcodeSettings model: 'gpt-5.6-terra'
#     GusgusSettings profile: 'pi'
#
# A subclass of a preferences class overrides some values and inherits the
# rest; `host: name` makes it the active class on that machine. Create one with
# `@ Trash newPreferencesClass: 'Name' subclassing: 'Preferences'`. See
# docs/settings-design.md.
Preferences subclass: Object

  # Every compiled preferences class; the active one is marked with "*".
  classPrimitive: all calls: trash_config_preferences

  # The active preferences class, or empty when none applies.
  classPrimitive: active calls: trash_preferences_active
